WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,030 --> 00:00:04,330
Don’t be fooled by your green tea sister again.

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,140
When did I get cheated by her?

3
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,540
I knew you were tough-talking

4
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,640
OK OK

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:11,840
You were not tricked

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,140
Then ask your green tea sister to buy gold coins for us.

7
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:16,740
Just as I said

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,340
Help me buy gold coins in the mall

9
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:21,530
If you don't have five gold coins, I'll give you one silver coin as reward.

10
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:25,240
I can only help you buy 25 gold coins at most

11
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,640
I need to leave five gold coins to upgrade the door.

12
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:29,940
Come to my room to trade

13
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,140
I'm still outside the community

14
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,840
It might take an hour or two to go back

15
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,940
Can you wait until I come back before trading?

16
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,440
Ligunli will be late today

17
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,740
It’s not cost-effective to use a trading platform

18
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,940
15% tax will be deducted for 25 gold coins

19
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,640
That is, 3.75 gold coins will be deducted.

20
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,140
When one goes in and one goes out, the coins are not transferred.

21
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,140
Dare to go in and out of the community like this ordinary person?

22
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:48,140
You, the resident of Green Tea Sister

23
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,440
The talent should be great

24
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,120
All the coins have been transferred to your backpack

25
00:00:53,810 --> 00:00:55,010
Let’s see if the interest is here?
